WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.250
Run one lap of a four hundred
metre track in eighty seconds.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.250
Your average speed is
five metres per second.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.210
Not bad.

4
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:11.590
But your average velocity
for the lap is zero.

5
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.810
You certainly moved, and you
were never standing still.

6
00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.190
So how can your velocity
come out as nothing at all?

7
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.490
In this mission, you'll sort
quantities into scalars and

8
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.670
vectors, and tell distance
apart from displacement.

9
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.630
You'll calculate speed
from distance and time,

10
00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:31.350
and find acceleration from
a change in velocity.

11
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.170
Your mission: find out how a
whole lap gives zero average

12
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.430
velocity.
